      "ImageDescription": {
        "value": "PACIFIC OCEAN (Sept. 17, 2011) The guided-missile cruiser USS Bunker Hill (CG 52) transits the Pacific Ocean. Bunker Hill is conducting a three-week composite training unit exercise in preparation for a deployment to the western Pacific Ocean. (U.S. Navy photo by Mass Communication Specialist Seaman John Grandin/Released)",
        "source": "commons-desc-page"
      },
